{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>AuraRead 是一款注重私隱的本地電子書閱讀器，適合喜歡深度閱讀、朗讀伴讀及整理書庫的讀者。圖書、筆記與進度保存在裝置，不需帳戶，也不上傳雲端；支援 TXT、EPUB、MOBI、PDF、CBZ、CBR、AZW3 等格式。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-259.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線朗讀與沉浸閱讀</h2>\n<p>朗讀支援逐句高亮跟讀，可調速度與音調，並設睡眠計時；亦可匯入 VITS、MeloTTS 等離線 AI 語音引擎。聆聽時開啟畫中畫，浮窗顯示當前與下一句，切換 App 或鎖屏後仍可繼續。閱讀提供翻頁、滾動與滑動模式，支援音量鍵翻頁、自動翻頁，並可調整字體、行距、背景與深色主題。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-272-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-273-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-274-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-275-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-276-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：AuraRead – Local Novel Reader</li><li>應用類別：Book</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/auraread-local-novel-reader/id6770079462?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:44:18.702533+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T20:16:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:37:41.847000+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T20:37:48.449762+00:00","content_hash":"bffa0fade2dcd9958e1dda08bdf5055e97b7a4611a3a0802f1492485d534a9c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}